<section id="about" class="section container"><div class="section-head reveal"><span>01 / PROFILE</span><h2>Academic depth.<br><em>Innovation mindset.</em></h2><p>Educator, researcher and innovation mentor working across applied AI, IoT, robotics, cybersecurity and student entrepreneurship.</p></div><div class="bento"><article class="card large reveal"><small>PROFESSIONAL PROFILE</small><h3>From classroom concepts to working systems.</h3><p>Assistant Professor in Computer Science and Engineering at Sri Ramakrishna Institute of Technology, with a practice centered on outcome-oriented teaching, experimentation, research and student innovation.</p><p>Research interests include machine learning, deep learning, computer vision, YOLO, medical image analysis, IoT-enabled smart agriculture, robotics / ROS and entrepreneurship.</p><div class="chips"><i>Teaching</i><i>Research</i><i>Mentoring</i><i>Innovation</i></div></article><article class="card identity reveal"><small>ACADEMIC IDENTITY</small><div><span>Role</span><b>Assistant Professor · CSE</b></div><div><span>Education</span><b>M.E. + B.E. · CSE</b></div><div><span>Since</span><b>02 July 2025</b></div><div><span>Scopus</span><b>59403144200</b></div></article><article class="card mission reveal"><small>MISSION</small><blockquote>Transform ideas into innovation, research into impact, and students into future technology leaders.</blockquote><b>G. Gokulraj</b></article></div></section>
