# G. Gokulraj — Advanced Portfolio

A clean, responsive, GitHub Pages-friendly portfolio for G. Gokulraj — AI, Research & Innovation.

## Included
- Single implementation (no competing portfolio copies)
- Responsive design system
- Three.js ambient research background with reduced-motion fallback
- GSAP scroll animation where available
- Interactive research domains
- Filterable project systems
- Journey / mentoring timeline
- Publications
- Searchable certificate archive linked to original PDFs
- Real resume with View + Download actions
- Endless Xplorers brand section with rectangular logo treatment

## Deploy
Upload the contents of this folder to the repository root and enable GitHub Pages from `main` / root.

All local asset paths are relative, so the site works on GitHub Pages project URLs.
